&INFO
Water, BLYP, 70 Ry, periodic 10 Angstrom cube, forces and stress
&END
&CPMD
 OPTIMIZE WAVEFUNCTION
 INITIALIZE WAVEFUNCTION ATOMS
 CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
  1.0d-12
 MAXSTEP
  30
 PRINT FORCES ON
 STRESS TENSOR
  1
&END
&DFT
 FUNCTIONAL BLYP
&END
&SYSTEM
 ANGSTROM
 SYMMETRY
  1
 CELL
  10.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
 CUTOFF
  70
&END
&ATOMS
*O_GTH_BLYP.psp
 LMAX=P
  1
  5.000000000  5.000000000  5.117300000
*H_GTH_BLYP.psp
 LMAX=S
  2
  5.000000000  5.757200000  4.530800000
  5.000000000  4.242800000  4.530800000
&END
